@fish,fisherman: Then the fish came swimming to him, and said, “Well, what is her will? What does your wife want?” “Ah!” said the fisherman, “she says that when I had caught you, I ought to have asked you for something before I let you go; she does not like living any longer in the pigsty, and wants a snug little cottage.”

@fish: “Go home, then,” said the fish; “she is in the cottage already!”

